name: sim.getOctreeVoxels
description: Retrieves voxel positions from an OC tree
luaSynopsis: list voxels = sim.getOctreeVoxels(int octreeHandle)
pythonSynopsis: float[] voxels = sim.getOctreeVoxels(int octreeHandle)
inputs:
1. octreeHandle: handle of the OC tree
outputs:
1. voxels: the voxel [x y z] positions, relative to the OC tree reference frame
replacedBy:
- name: packedPoints, class: ocTree, file: ocTree_packedPoints.property
- name: points, class: ocTree, file: ocTree_points.property
